    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(After School)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "When I come home after school,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "my mother is always glad to see me."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I say, \"Mom! I’m home,\" and then I take off my backpack and"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "wash my face and feet."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My mom replies, \"How was your day?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "After I chat with my mom for a little while, I go to my room,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and I sometimes play on the computer."
    },
